    description: "BibTeX: an entry with blanks between '{' and its key (@Article{         ghys87:groupes,) parses as key_brace '' plus an ERROR node; _extract_entry returns None for every such entry, so the file yields 0 symbols.\n\nRepro: analyze_bibtex on ~/whole_bunch_of_repos/mathlib4/docs (references.bib, 424 entries) -> 0 symbols.\n\nCLOSE WHEN that file yields one symbol per entry, with a fixture holding the blank-before-key form.\n\nFound by the PR 3 (stable-id v16) WI-rozod/WI-zolat build, 2026-11-19; evidence ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/fast_smart_test_build_11172026/pr3/rozod/RESULTS.md (Residuals)."  # d8b9
